(text "DAC8760 IOUT boost (SBAS528D 8.4.2): no room next to U7/U8 without moving ISET-R / REF / AVDD parts." (at 21.59 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5888ac0e-6af3-5e42-8dc0-c0facb908723))
(text "  -> worst case 0.73 W per DAC (28 V, 24 mA short): thermal test on a potted prototype;" (at 21.59 102.108 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a8405aaf-71c5-5430-8114-8dd75b7f44ab))
(text "     if too hot: limit spec (supply <= 24 V or load >= 250 ohm) or add boost in next PCB rev." (at 21.59 107.696 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid dcec0a3e-56b1-5cad-b4f5-8c55aabe913b))
(text "HSE crystal: no room next to PF0/PF1 -> factory HSI trim + firmware HSI calibration" (at 21.59 113.284 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e8fbd2cd-1f8b-5625-9d1a-0fed3f14eb08))
(text "  from Modbus frame timing (USART auto-baud / timer capture)." (at 21.59 118.872 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fd2a83b2-238a-5f2d-a763-2697e408ccf9))
(text "Sensor-line ESD array: no room next to J3 -> probe ESD test (IEC 61000-4-2) decides;" (at 21.59 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a430437d-ade0-57ae-a11e-212100f3896c))
(text "  if needed: protect at the HTX99R side or in the next PCB rev." (at 21.59 130.048 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5549c12a-8cfe-5776-b0b0-643a3d2df322))
